<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>´Daniel Krba — Portfolio</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Syne:wght@400;700;800&family=DM+Mono:wght@300;400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    :root {
      --bg: #0d0d0d;
      --surface: #161616;
      --border: #2a2a2a;
      --accent: #c8f542;
      --text: #f0f0f0;
      --muted: #666;
      --font-display: 'Syne', sans-serif;
      --font-mono: 'DM Mono', monospace;
    }

    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

    body {
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      min-height: 100vh;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    /* NOISE OVERLAY */
    body::before {
      content: '';
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 256 256' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='noise'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='0.9' numOctaves='4' stitchTiles='stitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23noise)' opacity='0.04'/%3E%3C/svg%3E");
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 100;
      opacity: 0.35;
    }

    /* NAV */
    nav {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
      padding: 1.25rem 2.5rem;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      z-index: 50;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: rgba(13,13,13,0.85);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    }

    .nav-logo {
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 2rem; }
    .nav-links a {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: color 0.2s;
    }
    .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--text); }

    /* HERO */
    .hero {
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 8rem 2.5rem 4rem;
      position: relative;
    }

    .hero-tag {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--accent);
      letter-spacing: 0.15em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      opacity: 0;
      animation: fadeUp 0.6s 0.2s forwards;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(3.5rem, 10vw, 8rem);
      font-weight: 800;
      line-height: 0.95;
      letter-spacing: -0.04em;
      max-width: 900px;
      opacity: 0;
      animation: fadeUp 0.6s 0.35s forwards;
    }

    .hero h1 span { color: var(--accent); }

    .hero-sub {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin-top: 2rem;
      max-width: 480px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      opacity: 0;
      animation: fadeUp 0.6s 0.5s forwards;
    }

    .hero-cta {
      margin-top: 3rem;
      display: flex;
      gap: 1rem;
      opacity: 0;
      animation: fadeUp 0.6s 0.65s forwards;
    }

    .btn-primary {
      padding: 0.8rem 1.8rem;
      background: var(--accent);
      color: #000;
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      border: none;
      cursor: pointer;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: transform 0.15s, box-shadow 0.15s;
    }
    .btn-primary:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(200,245,66,0.25); }

    .btn-secondary {
      padding: 0.8rem 1.8rem;
      background: transparent;
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      cursor: pointer;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: border-color 0.2s, color 0.2s;
    }
    .btn-secondary:hover { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); }

    /* SCROLLING MARQUEE */
    .marquee-wrap {
      overflow: hidden;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 1rem 0;
      background: var(--surface);
    }
    .marquee {
      display: flex;
      gap: 3rem;
      width: max-content;
      animation: marquee 20s linear infinite;
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    }
    .marquee span { color: var(--accent); }

    /* SECTIONS */
    section { padding: 6rem 2.5rem; }

    .section-label {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      color: var(--accent);
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 1rem;
    }
    .section-label::after {
      content: '';
      flex: 1;
      height: 1px;
      background: var(--border);
    }

    /* PROJECTS */
    .projects-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }

    .project-card {
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: var(--surface);
      padding: 2rem;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      transition: border-color 0.2s, transform 0.2s;
      cursor: default;
    }
    .project-card::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
      height: 2px;
      background: var(--accent);
      transform: scaleX(0);
      transform-origin: left;
      transition: transform 0.3s;
    }
    .project-card:hover { border-color: #444; transform: translateY(-3px); }
    .project-card:hover::before { transform: scaleX(1); }

    .project-num {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .project-title {
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }

    .project-desc {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.7;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .project-tags {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    .tag {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      padding: 3px 10px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    /* SKILLS */
    .skills-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .skill-item {
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
      background: var(--surface);
    }

    .skill-name {
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .skill-bar {
      height: 2px;
      background: var(--border);
      position: relative;
    }

    .skill-fill {
      position: absolute;
      top: 0; left: 0; bottom: 0;
      background: var(--accent);
      width: 0;
      transition: width 1s cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1);
    }

    /* ABOUT */
    .about-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 4rem;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .about-text {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.9;
    }

    .about-stats {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }

    .stat {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding-top: 1rem;
    }

    .stat-num {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--accent);
      letter-spacing: -0.04em;
      line-height: 1;
    }

    .stat-label {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin-top: 0.4rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    }

    /* CONTACT */
    .contact-inner {
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: var(--surface);
      padding: 4rem;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .contact-inner h2 {
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem);
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -0.04em;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .contact-inner h2 span { color: var(--accent); }

    .contact-inner p {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    }

    /* FOOTER */
    footer {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 2rem 2.5rem;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    /* ANIMATIONS */
    @keyframes fadeUp {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); }
      to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }

    @keyframes marquee {
      from { transform: translateX(0); }
      to   { transform: translateX(-50%); }
    }

    /* RESPONSIVE */
    @media (max-width: 700px) {
      .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .contact-inner { padding: 2rem; }
      nav { padding: 1rem 1.25rem; }
      .nav-links { gap: 1.2rem; }
      section { padding: 4rem 1.25rem; }
      .hero { padding: 7rem 1.25rem 3rem; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <nav>
    <div class="nav-logo">DK</div>
    <div class="nav-links">
      <a href="#projects">Projects</a>
      <a href="#skills">Skills</a>
      <a href="#about">About</a>
      <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-tag">// Available for opportunities</div>
    <h1>Daniel<br><span>Krba</span><br>2025.</h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">Junior web developer learning HTML, CSS & JavaScript. Building projects, solving problems, growing every day.</p>
    <div class="hero-cta">
      <a href="#projects" class="btn-primary">View Projects</a>
      <a href="#contact" class="btn-secondary">Get in touch</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="marquee-wrap">
    <div class="marquee">
      <span>HTML</span> · CSS · <span>JavaScript</span> · Responsive Design · <span>Git</span> · GitHub · <span>Web Development</span> · Front-End · <span>HTML</span> · CSS · <span>JavaScript</span> · Responsive Design · <span>Git</span> · GitHub · <span>Web Development</span> · Front-End ·
    </div>
  </div>

  <section id="projects">
    <div class="section-label">Projects</div>
    <div class="projects-grid">

      <div class="project-card">
        <div class="project-num">01</div>
        <div class="project-title">Portfolio Website</div>
        <div class="project-desc">Personal portfolio page built with HTML and CSS. Responsive layout, dark theme, and clean design.</div>
        <div class="project-tags">
          <span class="tag">HTML</span>
          <span class="tag">CSS</span>
          <span class="tag">Responsive</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="project-card">
        <div class="project-num">02</div>
        <div class="project-title">To-Do App</div>
        <div class="project-desc">Task management web app with add, complete and delete functionality. Data persists via localStorage.</div>
        <div class="project-tags">
          <span class="tag">HTML</span>
          <span class="tag">CSS</span>
          <span class="tag">JavaScript</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="project-card">
        <div class="project-num">03</div>
        <div class="project-title">Weather Dashboard</div>
        <div class="project-desc">Live weather app powered by OpenWeatherMap API. Search any city and see current conditions.</div>
        <div class="project-tags">
          <span class="tag">JavaScript</span>
          <span class="tag">API</span>
          <span class="tag">Fetch</span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="skills">
    <div class="section-label">Skills</div>
    <div class="skills-grid">
      <div class="skill-item">
        <div class="skill-name">HTML</div>
        <div class="skill-bar"><div class="skill-fill" data-width="85"></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="skill-item">
        <div class="skill-name">CSS</div>
        <div class="skill-bar"><div class="skill-fill" data-width="75"></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="skill-item">
        <div class="skill-name">JavaScript</div>
        <div class="skill-bar"><div class="skill-fill" data-width="55"></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="skill-item">
        <div class="skill-name">Git & GitHub</div>
        <div class="skill-bar"><div class="skill-fill" data-width="60"></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="skill-item">
        <div class="skill-name">Responsive Design</div>
        <div class="skill-bar"><div class="skill-fill" data-width="70"></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="skill-item">
        <div class="skill-name">VS Code</div>
        <div class="skill-bar"><div class="skill-fill" data-width="80"></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="about">
    <div class="section-label">About</div>
    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="about-text">
        Hi, I'm a student interested in web development. I started learning HTML and CSS not long ago and have been building small projects to practise. I enjoy turning ideas into working pages and I'm always looking to improve.<br><br>
        Currently focused on front-end development — making things look good and work well in the browser. Open to collaboration and always happy to connect.
      </div>
      <div class="about-stats">
        <div class="stat"><div class="stat-num">3</div><div class="stat-label">Projects</div></div>
        <div class="stat"><div class="stat-num">3</div><div class="stat-label">Technologies</div></div>
        <div class="stat"><div class="stat-num">∞</div><div class="stat-label">Curiosity</div></div>
        <div class="stat"><div class="stat-num">CZ</div><div class="stat-label">Based in</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="contact">
    <div class="contact-inner">
      <h2>Let's<br><span>Connect.</span></h2>
      <p>Open to feedback, collaboration or just a chat about code.</p>
      <a href="mailto:your@email.com" class="btn-primary">Say Hello →</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <span>© 2025 Daniel Krba</span>
    <span>Built with HTML & CSS</span>
  </footer>

  <script>
    // Animate skill bars when in view
    const fills = document.querySelectorAll('.skill-fill');
    const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
      entries.forEach(e => {
        if (e.isIntersecting) {
          e.target.style.width = e.target.dataset.width + '%';
        }
      });
    }, { threshold: 0.3 });
    fills.forEach(f => observer.observe(f));
  </script>

</body>
</html>
